9) |\n| Foreign | (182) | (1,794) | (1,042) |\n| State | (635) | (2,158) | (776) |\n| Total deferred income taxes | $(7,709) | $(20,535) | $(3,927) |\n| Provision (benefit) for income tax on |  |  |  |\n| continuing operations before |  |  |  |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tnoncontrolling\\tinterests\\t(1) | $(6,733) | $(20,326) | $(2,546) |\n| Provision (benefit) for income taxes on |  |  |  |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tdiscontinued\\toperations | (106) | (79) | 344 |\n| Provision (benefit) for income taxes on |  |  |  |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tcumulative\\teffect\\tof\\taccounting\\tchanges | — | — | (109) |\n| Income tax expense (benefit) reported in |  |  |  |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tstockholders'\\tequity\\trelated\\tto: |  |  |  |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tForeign\\tcurrency\\ttranslation | (415) | (2,116) | 565 |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSecurities\\tavailable-for-sale | 2,765 | (5,468) | (759) |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tEmployee\\tstock\\tplans | 1,351 | 449 | (410) |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tCash\\tflow\\thedges | \\t 1,165 | (1,354) | \\t(1,705) |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPension\\tliability\\tadjustments | (513) | (918) | 426 |\n| \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTax\\ton\\texchange\\toffer\\tbooked\\tto |  |  |  |\n| retained earnings | 3,523 | — | — |\n| Income taxes before noncontrolling interests | $ 1,037 | $(29,812) | $(4,194) |\n\n\t\t\t\t\tThe\treconciliation\tof\tthe\tfederal\tstatutory\tincome\ttax\trate\tto\tthe\tCompany's effective\tincome\ttax\trate\tapplicable\tto\tincome\tfrom\tcontinuing\toperations (before\tnoncontrolling\tinterests\tand\tthe\tcumulative\teffect\tof\taccounting changes)\tfor\tthe\tyears\tended\tDecember\t31\twas\tas\tfollows:\n\n|  | 2009 | 2008 | 2007 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Federal statutory rate | 35.0% | 35.0% | 35.0% |\n| State income taxes, net of federal benefit | 8.4 | 2.7 | (70.4) |\n| Foreign income tax